Overview

Geo-Chem India currently manages customer sample requests, pickup scheduling, laboratory testing, report generation, and customer communication through multiple manual processes.

The objective of this platform is to provide a centralized, AI-powered workflow management system that automates customer interactions, sample tracking, report delivery, notifications, and feedback collection while improving operational efficiency and customer experience.

The platform will leverage AI Agents, Telegram/WhatsApp communication channels, workflow automation, and real-time status tracking.

