Functional Requirements
Module 1: Customer Request Creation
Description

Customers can create sample testing requests through Telegram Bot.

Workflow
Customer initiates request
AI agent collects required information
System validates data
Order ID is generated
Request is stored in database
Confirmation is sent to customer
Required Fields
